# Signal type constructors: POSIX signal variants defined in prelude.llt.
# Each signal is a zero-payload Variant value (no data attached).
# Signal: [type [SIGTERM] [SIGINT] [SIGHUP] [SIGQUIT] [SIGUSR1] [SIGUSR2]]
[term:   SIGTERM
 int:    SIGINT
 hup:    SIGHUP
 quit:   SIGQUIT
 usr1:   SIGUSR1
 usr2:   SIGUSR2]
=== out
Dict({"term": Variant(SIGTERM, Null), "int": Variant(SIGINT, Null), "hup": Variant(SIGHUP, Null), "quit": Variant(SIGQUIT, Null), "usr1": Variant(SIGUSR1, Null), "usr2": Variant(SIGUSR2, Null)})
